Package: CondPED
Type: Package
Title: Conditional Projection for Decomposing Genetic Effects in Multi-Trait GWAS
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Mingzhe",
           family = "Suo",
           email = "suomingzhe1@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))
)
Description: Provides a conditional projection framework for decomposing SNP effects 
    into independent and shared components in multi-trait genome-wide association 
    studies (GWAS). The method constructs conditional phenotypes via covariance-based 
    projection and performs bidirectional conditional testing to identify trait-specific 
    quantitative trait loci (QTL). It enables distinction between direct genetic effects 
    and covariance-mediated associations using a unified statistical framework.
